WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Your life. Organised.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Axon, the self-hosted life OS.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Your day, at a glance. Tasks, habits, and goals in one view.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.400
Do what matters. GTD and Kanban, without the clutter.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.600
Think in connections. A Zettelkasten graph of your notes.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.800
Remember for good. Spaced repetition that measures your memory.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.000
Grow, skill by skill. A roadmap with its schedule and its trophies.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.200
Deep work. Pomodoro, with music made for it.

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.400
Watch your field. News, videos, and podcasts, read and connected.

10
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.600
Feel better. Water, coffee, sleep, and what helps you.

11
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.800
Decide better. Forecasts, scored against what happened.

12
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.000
Collect your progress. Trophies, from bronze to gold.

13
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Everything. In one place.

14
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Private by design. On your server.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Axon. Open source. Try the demo.
